1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,669
Stagepay keeps work and its test-payment decisions together.

2
00:00:04,669 --> 00:00:09,336
This walkthrough uses real local contracts and demo roles.

3
00:00:09,336 --> 00:00:15,462
Write a clear scope for the guide handover.

4
00:00:15,462 --> 00:00:21,073
Split the work into two payments: 10 and 20 DEMO.

5
00:00:21,073 --> 00:00:25,757
Test tokens only. A dispute needs both people to settle.

6
00:00:25,757 --> 00:00:30,856
Fund the agreement and wait for its confirmed receipt.

7
00:00:30,856 --> 00:00:34,543
Switch to the freelancer and agree to the exact scope.

8
00:00:34,543 --> 00:00:39,087
The agreement starts only after the freelancer accepts it.

9
00:00:39,087 --> 00:00:44,597
Attach the first setup note and explain what is ready.

10
00:00:44,597 --> 00:00:49,685
Submitting work records its hash. It does not release payment.

11
00:00:49,685 --> 00:00:53,359
The client reviews the delivery before deciding.

12
00:00:53,359 --> 00:00:56,456
Ask for the missing recovery steps.

13
00:00:56,456 --> 00:01:01,514
A revision keeps all 30 DEMO in escrow.

14
00:01:01,514 --> 00:01:05,201
The freelancer can now deliver the corrected guide.

15
00:01:05,201 --> 00:01:10,741
Link the full setup guide and explain the correction.

16
00:01:10,741 --> 00:01:14,819
Submit the revised evidence for a fresh review.

17
00:01:14,819 --> 00:01:19,913
The client accepts this milestone once.

18
00:01:19,913 --> 00:01:23,420
Accepted work stays paid when the remaining scope changes.

19
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:29,551
Clarify the unpaid guide without changing the accepted milestone.

20
00:01:29,551 --> 00:01:33,217
The freelancer reviews the proposed change.

21
00:01:33,217 --> 00:01:38,293
Both agree. The first 10 DEMO remains available as credit.

22
00:01:38,293 --> 00:01:43,996
Withdraw the accepted payment. Unpaid work stays in escrow.

23
00:01:43,996 --> 00:01:48,680
Export the record with its decisions and transaction receipts.

24
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:54,847
The hosted site has a separate, real Sepolia test agreement.

25
00:01:54,847 --> 00:01:59,939
It is closed, with both parties’ credits withdrawn.

26
00:01:59,939 --> 00:02:06,054
Each confirmed transaction has a public explorer receipt.

27
00:02:06,054 --> 00:02:11,757
Test tokens only. Shared scope, clear review, traceable decisions.
